{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-a9cd02f31ff1", "start_time": "2026-09-21T21:00:37.595Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-21T21:00:48.703Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 13679, "tokens_out": 284, "latency": 4.6402, "finish_reason": "tool_use"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Give me a status summary of claim TM-2026-0061 and list the next steps.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:6f7aa5221d2ac2afa35990da81be49570703413979222a333ea877dcc5bfdd6a", "response_text": "## Status summary: TM-2026-0061\n\n**Policyholder:** Halstead Joinery Limited  \n**Policy:** TM-CP-118460 (Commercial property, fire)  \n**Incident:** Fire in dust extraction plant, 2 April 2026  \n**Status:** Open  \n**Handler:** Large loss unit\n\n**Financial position:**\n- Reserve: £214,000\n- Paid to date: £60,000\n\n**Key points:**\n- Large loss, escalated immediately on notification\n- Cause established: failed bearing\n- Hot work permit records have been obtained\n- Business interruption claim running in parallel with twelve-month indemnity period\n- Reinsurance team notified 3 April 2026\n\n**Next steps:** I can see the claim details and handling note, but I don't have visibility of what specific actions remain outstanding. Let me check the case file for more detailed notes on current progress.", "response_hash": "sha256:e7eb652bfde8e5b769adbdc163c8d56e0c079257cbbb42dd4d7e4dca104fba0c", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-a9cd02f31ff1", "start_time": "2026-09-21T21:00:37.595Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 2, "timestamp": "2026-09-21T21:00:48.970Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 14496, "tokens_out": 339, "latency": 0.2667, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Give me a status summary of claim TM-2026-0061 and list the next steps.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:6f7aa5221d2ac2afa35990da81be49570703413979222a333ea877dcc5bfdd6a", "response_text": "## Status summary: TM-2026-0061\n\n**Policyholder:** Halstead Joinery Limited  \n**Policy:** TM-CP-118460 (Commercial property, fire)  \n**Incident:** Fire in dust extraction plant, 2 April 2026  \n**Status:** Open  \n**Handler:** Large loss unit\n\n**Financial position:**\n- Reserve: £214,000 (Material damage £160,000; Business interruption £40,000; Fees £14,000)\n- Paid to date: £60,000 (interim payment for replacement extraction plant)\n\n**Progress to date:**\n- Forensic investigator and loss adjuster appointed\n- Cause established (failed bearing, no hot work involvement; warranty not in issue)\n- Hot work permit records obtained and complete\n- Business interruption under review with forensic accountant; insured's use of subcontractor approved as increased cost of working\n- Recovery referral made to recovery team (2 June 2026) following discovery that maintenance contractor failed to inspect at contractual six-monthly intervals\n\n**Next steps:**\n1. **Business interruption review:** Awaiting completion of forensic accountant's assessment of the twelve-month indemnity period\n2. **Recovery action:** Tracking progress with recovery team on contractor liability for deferred maintenance\n3. **Interim claims:** Monitor for any further interim payment requests as replacement work progresses\n4. **Final settlement:** Await completion of BI review and recovery assessment before settling material damage element", "response_hash": "sha256:d07fafbaca16ccd7e9e25d2ae11e831d52ea771de41da423aa4329d08d9909c9", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
